/* ListBoxHtmlV rows contain a complete four-column HTML table.  A 128-wide
 * scratch buffer was sufficient for buttons but rejected the authoritative
 * compact row before the native setter ever ran.  Keep the large conversion
 * path isolated to these bounded row payloads rather than enlarging every
 * routine that writes a short label. */
